WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.462
Just be who you are Selena.

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:09.134
No one cares about what you’re doing.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.302
It’s about who I am.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:14.389
Being okay with where I am.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.560
I am grateful to be alive.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.230
Selena Gomez

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.565
Was diagnosed with lupus,

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.983
depression and anxiety.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.192
She had a mental breakdown.

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:28.069
Let me make a promise.

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:31.823
I am going to stop living like this.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.578
How do I learn to breathe my own breath again?

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.374
If anybody saw what I saw

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.042
they wouldn’t have recognized her.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.921
Like my whole life since I was a kid I’ve been working.

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:49.883
And I don’t wanna be like super famous.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.676
But I do know that if I’m

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.928
here that I have to use that for good.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.097
What’s holding you back from doing it?

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.892
That I’m not good enough.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.771
That’s something that I felt a lot of growing up.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:06.483
In this life, you have to show people empathy.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:09.402
Have a chance to give people more than what you receive.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.322
What makes me happy is connection

00:01:12.322 --> 00:01:14.657
and it helps me get out of my head.

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:15.533
Do you know who this is?

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:16.826
[Screaming]

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:17.827
Yes she’s real.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:18.995
Mommy went to school with her.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:23.082
Clearly I’m still here to use

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.460
whatever I have to help someone else.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:32.842
♪My mind and me. We don’t get along sometimes

00:01:32.842 --> 00:01:39.516
and it gets hard to breathe but I wouldn’t change my life.♪

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:42.477
Everything that I have gone through,

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:43.728
it’s gonna be there.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:46.147
I’m just making it my friend now.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:49.526
I am happier and I’m in control

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:52.946
of my emotions and thoughts more than I have ever been.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.489
I think that you are saving lives.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:56.825
I know that you’re saving lives, so thank you.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:57.784
I just hope that I’m a part of the

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.369
conversation ya know?

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.913
♪If somebody sees me like this then they

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:04.874
won’t feel alone.♪

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:06.793
I know this is the beginning for me.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.878
♪My mind and me.♪

00:02:11.339 --> 00:02:12.966
I love you.

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:14.551
I love you.

